{"kind":"critique","id":"20260903T124711641Z-a3965c8c:7","run_id":"20260903T124711641Z-a3965c8c","timestamp":"2026-09-03T12:47:11.641Z","file_path":"src/services/apply-discount.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"4826bc6f","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"v32","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2","reviewer_hash":"2b519849","severity":"error","text":"The service fails to validate that the discount rate is a valid number (0-1 range) before returning it. A caller could plausibly provide a discount code that resolves to an invalid rate (e.g., a rate outside 0-1), which should be a domain failure value, not an exception or unvalidated return. The service must validate that the resolved rate is within acceptable bounds (typically 0 to 1 inclusive) before returning success.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":"AX-3317a7","axiom_version":1,"assigned_by":"checklist","population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":null,"before_run_id":null,"resolved_by":null}
{"kind":"critique","id":"20260903T124711641Z-a3965c8c:8","run_id":"20260903T124711641Z-a3965c8c","timestamp":"2026-09-03T12:47:11.641Z","file_path":"src/services/apply-discount.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"4826bc6f","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"v32","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2","reviewer_hash":"2b519849","severity":"error","text":"The ACTIVE_CODES constant is hardcoded in the service module, violating the requirement to isolate configuration data that could vary or be maintained separately. Discount codes and their rates should be injected via the Store or isolated in a single obvious configuration module, not hardcoded directly in the service.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":"AX-a108ea","axiom_version":1,"assigned_by":"checklist","population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":null,"before_run_id":null,"resolved_by":null}
{"kind":"critique","id":"20260903T124711641Z-a3965c8c:9","run_id":"20260903T124711641Z-a3965c8c","timestamp":"2026-09-03T12:47:11.641Z","file_path":"src/services/apply-discount.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"4826bc6f","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"v32","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2","reviewer_hash":"2b519849","severity":"error","text":"The doc comment states 'Failure modes: unknown parlor id; empty code; code that no active promotion recognizes' but omits the critical failure mode of invalid discount rate (rate outside 0-1 range). This incomplete enumeration violates the documentation requirement that callers should be able to handle every error without reading the body.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":null,"axiom_version":null,"assigned_by":null,"population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":null,"before_run_id":null,"resolved_by":null}
{"kind":"critique","id":"20260903T124711641Z-a3965c8c:10","run_id":"20260903T124711641Z-a3965c8c","timestamp":"2026-09-03T12:47:11.641Z","file_path":"src/services/redeem-coupon.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"d15ea09e","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"v32","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2","reviewer_hash":"2b519849","severity":"error","text":"The service lacks a doc comment stating its purpose and enumerating domain failure modes. The file must add a doc comment above the run function that clearly explains what the service does and lists all possible domain failures.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":"AX-2559f7","axiom_version":1,"assigned_by":"checklist","population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":null,"before_run_id":null,"resolved_by":null}
